[ti:月まで届け、紅蓮の炎]
[al:Oriental FullMooN]
[ar:FullMooN.13]
[cv:https://upload.thbwiki.cc/thumb/1/19/Oriental_FullMooN%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg/400px-Oriental_FullMooN%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg]
